  "_comment": "Canonical CUR 2.0 column catalogue. Mirrors the CID data-exports template so CID SQL queries and dashboards work unchanged.",
  "_source": {
    "repo": "aws-solutions-library-samples/cloud-intelligence-dashboards-data-collection",
    "path": "data-exports/deploy/data-exports-aggregation.yaml",
    "commit": "f73fd0743b6a0a59230551be1febe35820e36ace",
