    "retrieved": "2026-07-09"
  },
  "_notes": [
    "query_columns: SELECT list for the BCM Data Exports export. A conditional group MUST be included only when its INCLUDE_* flag is TRUE, otherwise CreateExport fails with 'Columns are not a subset of table'.",
    "table_columns: initial Glue table schema, taken verbatim from CID. It intentionally declares a few columns that may be absent from the data (e.g. tags, and the conditional groups) - ParquetHiveSerDe resolves columns by name and returns NULL for missing ones, so the table needs no conditionals.",
    "The Glue crawler (AddOrUpdateBehavior=MergeNewColumns) reconciles any exported column the initial table does not declare.",
    "BCM Data Exports rejects 'SELECT *' (ValidationException: Invalid QueryStatement); columns must always be enumerated. terraform-provider-aws issue #37860 was closed because the limitation is on the AWS side."
  ],
